  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Moreover, the ETH Data Archive's metadata is integrated in the Web of Science Data Citation Index (DCI). The DCI receives notification following the registration of a DOI (Digital Object Identifier) for research data.\n\nThe Digital Curation office advises members of ETH Zurich on all aspects of research data management."
